// Granted by Pixie's Explosive Rounds passive ascension (see ExplosiveRoundsPassiveUpgradeData) -
// while present, WeaponSystem.Equip/ApplyPixieExplosiveWeapon forces every one of her weapon shots
// to proc a small explosion, reusing Weapon.ExplosiveSequence* exactly like the Explosive Sequence
// weapon perk, just forced to Interval=1 (every shot, not every Nth). As a side effect
// (HitEffectUtility.ApplyExplosion always tags isExplosion=true), this is also what makes her base
// Chain Reaction passive's Instability marking fire reliably, instead of depending on an explosive
// weapon drop or perk roll (see DamageUtility.TryMarkExplodeOnDeath's own isExplosion gate).
component PixieExplosiveWeapon
{
    FP Radius;
    FP DamageMultiplier;
}
